{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":29,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"cfd9acb8-0059-468b-82a9-0c108ef08749","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270932420,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"PACK-电气经理/主任","OrgId":3009505,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、电气科室开发体系文件建立，例如设计规范、测试规范、DFMEA等\n 2、电气科室日常管理 \n3、PACK研发流程体系培训，使每位电气工程师熟练掌握开发流程 \n4、配电装置、铜排、高低压线束、CCS总成等零件供应链建立 \n5、配电装置、铜排、高低压线束、CCS总成等前瞻技术规划以及落地\n 6、负责编制科室组织构架、岗位，进行人员配置，完成定岗定编； \n7、项目进度及项目交付物质量把控 \n8、负责科室人员的评价、激励和能力培养； \n9、负责科室文化建设，思想建设，加强科室成员归属感； \n10、支持公司产品在生产、客户、市场端质量问题的技术分析；","Require":"1、本科及以上，机械、车辆，机电，自动化，电气等相关专业。 \n2、熟悉电池系统开发流程，电池系统设计； \n3、熟悉汽车产品设计、相关法规、开发流程； \n4、具有良好的问题分析解决能力、应变能力、沟通协调能力、团队合作能力、良好的抗压能力； \n5、6年以上Pack系统相关产品设计开发工作经验，2年以上科室管理经验。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-11T16:35:07","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"d97e5615-3c1b-4957-8fba-b7796d455fdb","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270932384,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"PACK-系统主任/经理","OrgId":3009337,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、电池系统设计开发\n1）负责客户电池需求对接，提供与客户需求匹配的技术方案，进行电池系统的方案设计与开发；负责电池系统方案、技术要求、技术协议、电池系统DVP等技术文件的编制，负责电池系统的技术目标达成；\n2）遵循电池开发流程，在售前对接、概念方案、详细设计开发、设计冻结、试制生产、DV测试、工程认可、量产交付等各个环节统筹结构、电气、热管理、BMS各板块的技术工作，按质按量完成开发过程中的交付物，根据项目节点组织各个开发阶段的设计评审，并对整体研发进度进行管控；\n3）负责统筹电池开发、调试过程中的设计问题的分析整改和设计变更闭环管理；\n4）负责联合销售客户走访，进行电池产品的介绍与推广；\n5）负责统筹研发VAVE降本方案的分析，评估，验证和导入；\n\n2、电池产品规划\n1）负责乘用车、客车、Van系、轻卡、重卡、储能等相关领域电池的市场需求调研、技术方向分析、竞品对标；\n2）负责电池新产品的技术规划和设计开发，完善电池产品谱系；\n\n3、技术知识积累\n1）负责电池行业前瞻技术的分析研究和项目应用；\n2）负责电池产品技术标准、设计规范、检验标准、交付物模板等技术文件的编制、发布和更新维护；\n3）负责电池相关国家标准，国际标准，行业标准的分析解读；\n4）负责电池技术的专利布局；\n5）负责培训和带教新人；","Require":"1、本科及以上，机械、车辆，机电，自动化，电气等相关专业，5年以上电池/汽车行业电池系统开发经验；\n2、对新能源汽车电池产品知识较熟悉，熟悉其工作原理和生产工艺过程；\n3、熟悉电池产品开发流程，清楚各阶段的关键动作及交付物；\n4、具备独立组织电池系统设计方案评审等工作的能力。具备独立对接客户技术要求，完成技术方案评估的能力。\n5、熟练使用 办公软件；具有良好的问题分析解决能力、应变能力、沟通协调能力、团队合作能力、良好的抗压能力；\n6、能适应不定期出差工作\n7、具备专业技能、开发流程培训的能力；具备带教新人的经验；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-05-11T16:03:57","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"a54233f0-740e-40cf-8c90-2db2d7977820","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270956973,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"选矿工程师（蒙金矿业）","OrgId":3008154,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责矿山选矿工艺的设计、优化与改进，根据矿石性质制定合理的选矿流程（如浮选、磁选、重选等）,确定工艺参数与设备选型；\n2、组织选矿车间的生产运行管理，监督破碎、磨矿、分选、脱水等各环节的生产指标（如回收率、精矿品位、尾矿品位），及时调整工艺参数，确保生产效率与产品质量；\n3、常态化跟踪现场工艺运行参数，指导操作工现场调机、指标调整；监督工艺标准落地执行，定期完成工艺数据统计、汇总、对比分析，形成工艺运行分析报告。\n4、定期培训现场操作工，不断提高员工操作技能；\n5、做好金属平衡及流程考察等工作；\n6、组织选矿工艺技术改造和工艺流程改革。","Require":"1、大学本科及以上学历，选矿相关专业，持有中级及以上选矿相关职称；\n2、具备10年及以上选矿专业现场技术工作经验，拥有锂矿、有色金属选矿实操经验、设计院从业经历、尾矿库管理经验者优先；具备复杂难选矿工艺攻关项目经验人员优先；\n3、熟练使用日常办公软件，可独立完成工艺数据整理、精准编制各类生产数据报表。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-07-17T18:04:19","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDelive