PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"采矿工程师（集团总部）","OrgId":3008572,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、作为总部职能，监督、管理集团子矿山采矿相关工作，确保年度生产目标达成；\n2、搭建、更新集团采矿标准化技术管理体系；\n3、组织、参与新建 / 改扩建矿山采矿初设、安设、施工图技术评审，出具专业优化方案；\n4、审核各矿山年度采掘计划、中长期开采规划，保障矿产资源合理可持续开发；\n5、督导矿山开采工艺执行，跟踪采场参数、回采顺序、贫化损失等关键指标，推动技术优化降损增效。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，采矿工程专业，专业基础扎实；\n2、10年以上矿山一线技术及生产管理工作经历，其中有5年以上大型金属非金属矿山（露天或地下）采矿工程师经验，具备完整主导矿山采区技术管理或改扩建项目的实战能力；\n3、精通制图软件、熟练应用至少一款三维矿业软件；\n4、熟悉主流采矿方法（空场法、崩落法、充填法等）的适用条件、设计要点及安全规程；深度理解国家矿山安全法、资源法、绿色矿山建设标准及最新行业规范；\n5、具备独立分析与解决复杂采矿技术问题的能力，能有效应对井下突发状况；优秀的跨部门协调能力、团队管理能力及工程现场组织能力；\n6、持有采矿工程师中级及以上职称，拥有注册采矿工程师执业资格或高级工程师职称者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-25T16:08:17","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"af544280-512f-4bd6-ac61-c25328a34908","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270949333,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"pack——结构资深工程师","OrgId":3009503,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"职责描述：\n1、负责根据客户SOR或其他需求分解CTS，制定方案和开发计划。 \n2、负责动力电池中PACK/MODULE结构零部件的3D、2D设计，BOM搭建以及相关设计校核文件编制，以确保满足系统安全性和可靠性。 \n3、负责编制结构零部件SOR、技术协议，供应商技术对接、OTS认可以及问题整改。 \n4、负责PACK结构板块的前沿技术调研和开发，并进行应用。 \n5、负责编制结构相关标准规范和技术文件。 ","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，机械/车辆/材料等相关专业； \n2、3年及以上PACK结构设计工作经验，主导动力电池量产项目至少一个； \n3、熟悉钣金、塑胶、压铸、挤铝等各种成型和加工工艺并了解相应材料特性； \n4、具有较强的执行力，熟练掌握结构设计软件。\n5、熟悉GD&T、尺寸工程，具有优异的沟通、协调、应变、能力、团队合作能力和抗压能力","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-24T17:37:58","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"5e0eaabc-b095-4490-8d75-df0afa17e348","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270948841,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电气工程师（万吨锂盐）","OrgId":3007804,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、电气设备巡检：根据工厂设备巡检制度，组织对设备的运行使用情况进行检查并做记录；\n2、设备检修、保养：对巡检过程中发现的设备故障和车间报修的设备故障，组织实施检修 ；\n3、电气维修人员设备维修过程中，提供必要的技术支持；\n4、掌握电气备品备件的耗用量，编制备品备件申购计划；\n5、负责协调水、电部门保障生产的正常运行，并申报水、电费；\n6、对车间的电气设备编制维护保养计划并组织落实，并按体系要求有输出；\n7、负责有关电气设备的验收工作并出具相关的报告.\n","Require":"1、本科学历，电气及相关专业；\n2、有3年以上化工行业电气管理经验；\n3、对高压和低压配电熟悉；熟练运用制图软件和办公软件；\n4、对电气故障能进行专业排查并解决，熟悉行业规范及标准。\n","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-24T09:34:21","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"e9c55c0e-62c4-4902-a50c-19c4614425e9","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270944411,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"技术研发部经理（昆明中航）","OrgId":3008363,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.矿山项目全流程管控\n1.1统筹矿山研发项目的内外部立项申报、费用核算与全过程管控、内外部验收组织等全生命周期管理工作。\n1.2负责公司级矿山项目的内外部立项审批流程跟进，牵头项目设计方案的评审、优化及落地执行与监督。\n2.矿山技术升级与绿色运营保障\n2.1调研矿山行业前沿技术、设备及方法，主导新技术、新设备的引进评估、试点应用及推广落地。\n2.2牵头落实绿色矿山持续性维护工作，确保各项指标符合绿色矿山建设及运营相关标准。\n3.矿山资源储备与扩张管理\n3.1制定矿山资源增储工作计划，统筹资源勘探、储量核实等相关工作推进。\n3.2参与矿山资源扩张项目的调研、规划及落地实施，保障矿山资源可持续供给。","Require":"1.学历专业：大专及以上学历，采矿、地质、测量等相关专业。\n2.工作经验：5年及以上工作经验；专业技术与项目管理能力兼备。\n3.专业能力：\n3.1拥有矿山生产、资源勘探、增储及扩张需具备的专业技术、流程管理及结果保障能力。\n3.2具备对各种采矿设备、工具的熟练使用和维护能力；了解矿山新技术发展趋势，具备技术引进可行性分析能力；掌握绿色矿山建设标准及资源勘探流程。\n3.3熟悉矿山项目立项、验收流程及费用管控方法，能独立完成项目文档编制与报审。\n3.4具备良好的沟通协调和团队管理能力，能对接内外部合作方（科研机构、供应商、监管部门）。\n4.优先条件\n4.1持有采矿工程师、注册安全工程师、地质工程师、测量工程师等中级及以上职业资格证书。\n4.2另有绿色矿山维护、资源增储项目主导经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-06-09T15:28:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"68a1e1ef-b474-4657-b436-c523c432745a","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270943953,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电气工程师（青海赣锋）","OrgId":3007808,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、工厂电气设备的维修、维护和保养工作。负责技术性指导、监督；\n2、工厂电气设备的选型、技改项目实施安装、调试运行管理工作；\n3、电气设备的日常巡检、点检、考核等工作；\n4、负责设备事故的调查处理工作并组织会议进行分析讨论；\n5、电气设备方面相关管理规定、制度的编制、修改及评审工作。","Require":"1、大专及以上学历，从事相关专业3年以上工作经验；\n2、熟练使用办公OFFICE及相关电气软件，掌握电力系统、电机控制、变压器、配电设备等知识；\n3、熟悉主流PLC控制系统，能进行自动化设备调试和优化；\n4、熟练